{
  "$comment": "Release gate for the built manifest. Any change to what the extension may access must be made here deliberately, in a reviewed commit, and justified in store/listing.md. Adding a permission can make Chrome disable the extension for existing users until they re-approve it, and triggers extra Web Store review. hostPermissions are the job sites where the floating widget appears (source ADR-0030); content scripts may match only those.",
